  <data name="PersonaNightOwlDesc" xml:space="preserve"><value>夜色越深，你与歌同到天明</value></data>
  <data name="PersonaStreakTitle" xml:space="preserve"><value>旋律成瘾者</value></data>
  <data name="PersonaStreakDesc" xml:space="preserve"><value>你的日子，一日无歌便觉冷清</value></data>
  <data name="PersonaLoyalTitle" xml:space="preserve"><value>忠实听众</value></data>
